WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.220
|||||\\\\\\\\\\\\\

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:43.120
Alchemy

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:43.120
Shower

00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:56.440
Boo Young, where did you feel the power of the ice stone?

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:57.640
Father

00:00:57.730 --> 00:00:58.940
We're close

00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:03.570
A rock somewhere nearby underwater

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:13.290
Do you really think she found the ice stone?

00:01:13.870 --> 00:01:14.950
Yes it must be him

00:01:15.910 --> 00:01:17.580
10 years ago my teacher Chang Gang

00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:20.290
hid the stone here in Gyeongjeongdaeho Lake

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:23.300
And now the stone was found by a girl born

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:25.670
using the power of the stone

00:01:27.010 --> 00:01:30.760
I'm sure Boo Young is Jang Gun's daughter

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:34.100
This explains why he saved her with magic

00:01:35.770 --> 00:01:37.430
Don't you like her?

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:48.570
Thanks to this girl

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:51.780
worthless I was able to marry

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:55.240
daughters of the Jin family

00:01:57.330 --> 00:01:59.040
I guess I should be grateful

00:02:02.170 --> 00:02:05.960
Here. The rock is right below us

00:02:17.850 --> 00:02:20.600
Father's complexes and jealousy

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:23.440
led Jin Bu Young to death

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:27.150
It suits you

00:02:28.190 --> 00:02:31.410
If you like it, then so do I, mom.

00:02:33.370 --> 00:02:35.160
Let's try something else

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:40.370
The Incredible Strength of Jin Bu Young

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:43.500
she inherited not only from her mother, a member of the Jin family

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:48.880
She is also strong thanks to the blood of her father, a descendant of the fallen Choi family.

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:52.240
Project coordinator and editor: Ria_Lee

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:57.240
Assistant coordinators: Martini, gaarysn

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:55.260
Choi's brother and sister, who made a living from fortune-telling,

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:58.720
were descendants of the magician Choi, the first who performed

00:02:57.240 --> 00:03:02.240
Typesetter translators: Ria_Lee, Mina_Mi, Zero Amamiya

00:02:58.810 --> 00:03:00.560
alchemy of souls

00:03:03.270 --> 00:03:05.560
Jin Bu Young was a descendant of both families,

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:09.320
which made her the strongest priestess the world has seen

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:12.240
You finally found him

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:14.160
Boo Young,

00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:16.120
give me the stone

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:29.460
Give it back!

00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:35.800
Boo Young...

00:03:36.390 --> 00:03:38.180
Boo Young

00:03:40.060 --> 00:03:41.140
Boo Young!

00:04:07.170 --> 00:04:08.840
Eat

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:11.340
Here, take the spoon

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:14.630
It's a pity that you're blind

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:17.430
The worst thing is that you don't even remember your name

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:22.020
Do you want to live with me?

00:04:22.890 --> 00:04:26.650
My deceased granddaughter's name was Moo Deok

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:27.900
Can I call you that?

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:31.980
Okay

00:04:32.070 --> 00:04:33.610
From now on you are Moo Deok

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:36.150
How cute

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:38.120
Let's eat

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:45.540
Moo Deok...

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:29.330
Mother

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:38.300
Boo Young...

00:05:53.770 --> 00:05:54.980
How is this possible?

00:05:56.780 --> 00:05:59.740
This happened on the day Boo Young disappeared

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:14.250
Moo Deok didn't return

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:17.710
The nomad probably killed him and Chan Wook

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:20.130
Then we will all die

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:27.680
Jin Bu Young

00:06:27.770 --> 00:06:30.480
You yourself brought the stone from Jinyeowon

00:06:31.230 --> 00:06:33.480
Are you a priestess, but you can't control him?

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:37.730
I followed my mother's instructions

00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:39.820
You're pathetic

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:44.200
Seo Yul lost too much blood

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:47.540
Without a transfusion he could die

00:06:48.410 --> 00:06:50.710
If you need blood, you can take mine

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:53.080
You can't cast spells here,

00:06:53.170 --> 00:06:55.000
therefore your blood cannot be used

00:07:02.550 --> 00:07:03.930
Reach out your hand

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:16.690
Worm from the blood of my daughter Cho Young

00:07:16.770 --> 00:07:19.570
will give you the strength of the Jin family

00:07:22.820 --> 00:07:26.410
Chan Wook fooled us all

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:32.040
The magicians of the Unified Council took turns reading the "Words of the Heart",

00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:34.120
but there's not a word about the stone

00:07:34.210 --> 00:07:36.840
Nothing more than a poem

00:07:40.380 --> 00:07:42.260
What will Sosnovy Bor say to this?

00:07:45.300 --> 00:07:46.720
All the magicians read it,

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:49.810
but there was something no one knew

00:07:57.110 --> 00:07:59.980
"Words of the Heart" - a love letter

00:08:00.070 --> 00:08:01.400
master Seo Kyung

00:08:01.490 --> 00:08:04.200
Message?

00:08:04.780 --> 00:08:08.330
A love letter for Jin Seol Ran,

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:09.870
first chapter of Jinyeowon

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:15.370
This is an admission that he did not destroy the stone because

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:19.500
that I couldn’t let go of my beloved who was dying

00:08:21.590 --> 00:08:23.510
So Master So Kyung

00:08:23.590 --> 00:08:26.930
didn't destroy the stone because of love?

00:08:27.890 --> 00:08:29.550
He's trying to fool you

00:08:30.140 --> 00:08:33.730
I can prove this is a love letter

00:08:35.560 --> 00:08:38.110
All you have to do is name the recipient's name in your head.

00:08:38.690 --> 00:08:42.070
and you can read this letter yourself, Your Majesty

00:08:42.150 --> 00:08:43.860
I can read the poem

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:46.660
even without being a magician?

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:48.700
Recipient's name

00:08:48.780 --> 00:08:53.080
will remind you of “an orchid flower that is covered in snow”

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:56.500
This is Sol Ran

00:08:57.870 --> 00:08:59.210
"Salt Ran"?

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:34.950
"I see the blue firmament. A quiet sigh is heard"

00:09:43.420 --> 00:09:46.880
"I know my eyes will fill with tears again"

00:09:47.970 --> 00:09:49.130
"But I'm a fool"

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:53.010
"didn't roll down my cheek"

00:09:54.220 --> 00:09:56.390
"not a single tear"

00:09:58.730 --> 00:10:00.400
This is his confession

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:03.900
the fact that he did not destroy the stone for the sake of his beloved

00:10:07.490 --> 00:10:09.530
But head Jin Seol Ran died

00:10:09.610 --> 00:10:11.620
in about six months

00:10:11.700 --> 00:10:16.080
after the founding of Jinyaewon due to injuries sustained during the Great Chaos

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:17.580
If the stone was for her,

00:10:17.660 --> 00:10:19.830
Why didn't she use it and save herself?

00:10:20.460 --> 00:10:24.250
I'm sure this is so that the world doesn't know

00:10:24.920 --> 00:10:26.670
such dangerous power

00:10:27.840 --> 00:10:31.300
Who would refuse such power?

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:32.800
A man like you

00:10:33.850 --> 00:10:36.310
I would never act like her

00:10:36.390 --> 00:10:39.100
And she did it for humanity

00:10:40.480 --> 00:10:41.730
Did the right thing

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:45.900
To protect what is due

00:10:48.360 --> 00:10:53.620
sometimes someone has to give up everything

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:12.260
Since you took the sword in your hands,

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:15.390
make your choice

00:11:20.140 --> 00:11:21.640
I know you've been avoiding me

00:11:21.730 --> 00:11:24.730
I know that our lives are in your hands

00:11:27.070 --> 00:11:30.740
As promised, point your sword at me first

00:11:43.120 --> 00:11:45.080
Excessive energy will lead to

00:11:45.170 --> 00:11:47.840
that you can't control the force you use

00:11:48.800 --> 00:11:51.420
If you want rain, you will get a flood

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:54.760
If you want wind, you will get a typhoon

00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:56.510
Try to cope

00:11:56.590 --> 00:11:59.470
So, I won't be able to control this power?

00:12:00.770 --> 00:12:03.600
There are some things you can do of your own free will.

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:07.020
Don't use it

00:12:08.360 --> 00:12:11.650
The choice is yours: to use force or not

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:27.330
Now, like you said,

00:12:29.420 --> 00:12:31.050
give me another promise

00:12:47.770 --> 00:12:49.110
Among the stars

00:12:49.190 --> 00:12:52.480
there is the saddest one - the star of the King

00:12:54.610 --> 00:12:56.780
What kind of star is this?

00:12:57.490 --> 00:12:58.820
Born under her sign

00:12:58.910 --> 00:13:01.200
can control the energy of heaven

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:03.870
Does this mean the person will be strong?

00:13:03.950 --> 00:13:05.620
That's good

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:09.960
How to say... It's not always something good

00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:12.000
The greater the power -

00:13:12.090 --> 00:13:14.050
the greater the responsibility

00:13:14.130 --> 00:13:16.090
What is "responsibility"?

00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:18.640
It's when you have to do something you don't want to do

00:13:18.720 --> 00:13:20.970
even if you feel sad and lonely later

00:13:21.050 --> 00:13:24.600
Ahjusshi, can I eat this?

00:13:25.810 --> 00:13:26.770
Of course

00:13:27.810 --> 00:13:30.730
- I should have given it earlier
- Thank you

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:34.480
Just don't fight over them

00:13:34.570 --> 00:13:36.150
Okay. We went

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:48.250
The star will appear soon

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:52.290
Then those who should disappear will disappear

00:13:52.380 --> 00:13:54.920
and those who need it will return

00:14:01.930 --> 00:14:05.770
This is the place the Crown Prince was looking for

00:14:06.430 --> 00:14:08.480
A shop where every month

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:10.940
walked the eunuch Kim, the queen's servant

00:14:11.020 --> 00:14:13.270
You are well oriented

00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:16.440
And that talisman so that the beloved will fall in love...

00:14:16.530 --> 00:14:17.860
Did you receive it here?

00:14:19.070 --> 00:14:22.160
He didn't even work, stop making fun of me

00:14:22.740 --> 00:14:26.200
How did it "not work"? We're together now

00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:28.500
Well...

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:31.330
We're not on a date

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:43.010
Why is he here?

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:47.270
Herbalist's shop

00:14:48.310 --> 00:14:49.480
Father?

00:15:27.510 --> 00:15:29.770
We came to our senses

00:15:29.850 --> 00:15:32.440
Tried to hurt yourself again, Your Highness

00:15:32.520 --> 00:15:34.600
Why are you keeping me alive?

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:37.520
Just kill him already

00:15:37.610 --> 00:15:40.820
Not yet. Queen's Lantern of Life

00:15:41.650 --> 00:15:44.490
must burn while the queen's body is still alive

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:50.450
It's scary that you look at me like that

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:53.960
with my sister's face

00:15:54.040 --> 00:15:56.290
It's not me you should be mad at

00:15:56.380 --> 00:15:58.170
The one who put it is to blame

00:15:59.340 --> 00:16:01.380
my sister and I are in this situation

00:16:13.310 --> 00:16:15.810
Shaman Choi, you cursed and harmed people

00:16:15.900 --> 00:16:17.940
using forbidden spells

00:16:18.900 --> 00:16:20.400
Do you admit your sins?

00:16:25.990 --> 00:16:29.780
I did what people asked for money

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:33.500
Those who asked me to curse someone are to blame

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:35.420
Your curse led to death!

00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:38.330
Are you pretending to be innocent?

00:16:42.010 --> 00:16:44.720
Spells that can kill...

00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:46.340
Amazed by your strength

00:16:46.970 --> 00:16:48.090
This strength

00:16:49.010 --> 00:16:53.470
it might even be enough to kill you

00:16:58.730 --> 00:17:02.780
Find all the spell books, everything she used!

00:17:02.860 --> 00:17:03.780
- Eat!
- Eat!

00:17:21.250 --> 00:17:22.920
No, not this!

00:17:23.800 --> 00:17:25.050
We are a poor family

00:17:25.130 --> 00:17:27.130
but this is our family heirloom

00:17:27.220 --> 00:17:29.510
I didn’t guess with her!

00:17:29.590 --> 00:17:30.760
Don't burn

00:17:31.350 --> 00:17:32.510
Chongan

00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:33.770
This is a book of spells

00:17:33.850 --> 00:17:34.890
No...

00:17:35.680 --> 00:17:36.600
Burn

00:17:39.520 --> 00:17:43.270
No!

00:17:43.780 --> 00:17:45.190
Chongan

00:18:01.540 --> 00:18:03.130
Put out the fire. Hurry!

00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:04.250
- Yes
- Yes

00:18:10.050 --> 00:18:15.100
Chongan

00:18:23.110 --> 00:18:25.400
Alchemy of Souls

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:27.530
"Alchemy of Souls"?

00:18:41.710 --> 00:18:43.040
Be patient, sister

00:19:01.390 --> 00:19:03.270
It all started with him

00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:04.900
He left these scars

00:19:04.980 --> 00:19:08.150
Because of him, my sister transferred her soul into your body

00:19:08.230 --> 00:19:10.240
It's his fault

00:19:11.650 --> 00:19:12.820
Chang Gang

00:19:14.620 --> 00:19:15.660
Chan...

00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:18.160
Gun...

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:21.160
You can't die yet

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:23.830
Live in my sister's body

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:26.340
just a little more

00:19:27.340 --> 00:19:28.380
Your Highness

00:19:33.760 --> 00:19:36.260
It's been over ten years since I got this body.

00:19:37.430 --> 00:19:40.770
But every time she regains consciousness it affects me

00:19:41.730 --> 00:19:44.730
If it weren't for the Lantern of Life, I would have killed her

00:19:44.810 --> 00:19:47.360
Your brother brought her medicine

00:19:48.440 --> 00:19:50.360
You'll feel better soon

00:19:51.780 --> 00:19:52.780
But...

00:19:54.200 --> 00:19:56.820
How did the stone end up in Jeonjingak?

00:19:56.910 --> 00:19:58.620
Jin Ho Kyung must have made a mistake

00:19:58.700 --> 00:20:00.750
because it was the first time I used a stone

00:20:01.750 --> 00:20:03.210
When the time comes

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:07.040
I use the power of the stone for the alchemy of souls

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:12.630
If you do this now, everyone in Jeonjingak will die.

00:20:12.720 --> 00:20:13.840
Yes I know

00:20:14.380 --> 00:20:15.970
The Crown Prince is there too

00:20:17.800 --> 00:20:18.970
So what?

00:20:20.520 --> 00:20:23.060
We have to wait for him to be rescued from there.

00:20:23.140 --> 00:20:24.560
Then you can collect the power of the stone

00:20:24.640 --> 00:20:26.020
What if he is not released?

00:20:27.100 --> 00:20:29.150
Should I just sit and wait?

00:20:29.230 --> 00:20:32.740
What if something takes the stone before me?

00:20:32.820 --> 00:20:36.410
Fortunately, no one does anything, everyone is just on alert

00:20:37.660 --> 00:20:41.580
We must find a way to save the Crown Prince.

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:56.880
Mother

00:21:03.430 --> 00:21:04.810
I thought I heard it

00:21:05.560 --> 00:21:07.230
Why would she call me that?

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:09.270
Laughter and nothing more

00:21:16.150 --> 00:21:17.200
Everyone

00:21:18.780 --> 00:21:21.030
I'm more worried about the ice stone,

00:21:23.040 --> 00:21:25.540
than the children locked there

00:21:27.210 --> 00:21:30.040
You and I must try to break down the barrier

00:21:31.750 --> 00:21:34.670
Let's do something without the consent of the council,

00:21:35.380 --> 00:21:37.090
there will be a scandal again

00:21:39.010 --> 00:21:41.350
The stone belongs to Jinyeowon

00:21:41.430 --> 00:21:44.060
Sosnovy Bor has no right to make decisions

00:21:44.140 --> 00:21:45.180
Head Jin,

00:21:45.730 --> 00:21:49.560
the stone never really left the walls of Jinyowon

00:21:49.650 --> 00:21:51.940
over the last 200 years?

00:21:54.570 --> 00:21:57.280
You once said that the magician of Sosnovy Bor had already entered Jinyeowon

00:21:57.780 --> 00:21:59.070
It's random

00:22:01.070 --> 00:22:02.330
wasn't Chang Gang?

00:22:06.330 --> 00:22:08.040
I asked a question

00:22:09.040 --> 00:22:12.790
Has Chang Gang ever used a stone?

00:22:24.310 --> 00:22:26.220
The baby inside doesn't move

00:22:26.310 --> 00:22:28.020
I carried her for 13 months

00:22:28.890 --> 00:22:30.020
I can't let her go

00:22:32.360 --> 00:22:33.610
I have to save her

00:22:34.230 --> 00:22:35.940
I'm sorry

00:22:36.980 --> 00:22:38.690
She's already dead

00:22:43.870 --> 00:22:45.200
In Jinyeowon

00:22:46.910 --> 00:22:47.870
there is an ice stone

00:22:49.830 --> 00:22:51.170
Ice stone?

00:22:51.250 --> 00:22:53.670
Why the surprise? You already suspected

00:22:53.750 --> 00:22:57.090
You asked to go to Jinyeowon so many times

00:22:57.920 --> 00:23:00.550
I know you wanted to find a stone there

00:23:04.140 --> 00:23:05.760
They say a stone can

00:23:05.850 --> 00:23:09.890
bring the dead back to life

00:23:11.310 --> 00:23:12.480
I don't have enough strength

00:23:14.190 --> 00:23:15.900
control the stone

00:23:16.730 --> 00:23:17.820
But to you, Chang Gang

00:23:18.690 --> 00:23:20.780
strength may be enough

00:23:22.950 --> 00:23:25.030
Are you asking to use dark magic?

00:23:25.120 --> 00:23:27.790
I will do anything to save my child

00:23:30.580 --> 00:23:31.540
Please

00:23:32.750 --> 00:23:34.920
Help me save him

00:23:45.680 --> 00:23:49.390
That night I opened Jinyaewon's door and let him in.

00:23:50.020 --> 00:23:52.310
in the hope that he will save my daughter

00:23:53.350 --> 00:23:56.980
And as a result, Jinyeowon lost the ice stone

00:24:05.360 --> 00:24:06.660
Even so,

00:24:07.660 --> 00:24:09.910
there is more guilt behind Sosnovy Bor

00:24:09.990 --> 00:24:13.540
Your magician always portrayed himself as righteous, but still

00:24:13.620 --> 00:24:15.460
took the ice stone

00:24:15.540 --> 00:24:18.960
Created the alchemy of souls and brought chaos to the earth

00:24:21.590 --> 00:24:23.760
That's why I wanted to hide it

00:24:25.180 --> 00:24:26.220
But

00:24:27.430 --> 00:24:30.640
I will do everything to reveal the truth and correct everything,

00:24:31.770 --> 00:24:34.230
even if you have to reveal the sins of Sosnovy Bor

00:24:35.980 --> 00:24:37.400
and punish the culprits

00:24:41.110 --> 00:24:44.820
Then you will have to pass judgment on the person you love

00:24:47.200 --> 00:24:48.530
It won't be easy

00:24:50.580 --> 00:24:51.790
I know

00:24:54.160 --> 00:24:55.120
But...

00:24:55.870 --> 00:25:00.090
if this is the only way to fix the situation,

00:25:03.300 --> 00:25:05.670
I'll do it

00:25:15.520 --> 00:25:17.690
My sister's soul will replace your body

00:25:17.770 --> 00:25:21.690
on the body of a girl who is pretending to be my eldest daughter

00:25:22.480 --> 00:25:24.070
Then

00:25:24.150 --> 00:25:27.740
I will kill you as you ask

00:25:43.000 --> 00:25:44.050
Cho Young,

00:25:46.090 --> 00:25:47.300
what...

00:25:47.380 --> 00:25:48.720
What are you doing here?

00:25:51.510 --> 00:25:52.720
Father,

00:25:53.810 --> 00:25:54.930
what the...

00:25:56.230 --> 00:25:58.060
nonsense... I just

00:25:59.230 --> 00:26:00.480
did you hear?

00:26:04.860 --> 00:26:07.860
Who is this woman?

00:26:09.030 --> 00:26:11.280
Imprisoned in this body

00:26:13.580 --> 00:26:15.540
the soul of a real queen?

00:26:45.110 --> 00:26:47.400
Father, stop

00:27:49.250 --> 00:27:50.300
Gwangju,

00:27:51.300 --> 00:27:52.550
is that you?

00:28:02.270 --> 00:28:03.350
Maid Kim,

00:28:04.350 --> 00:28:05.770
long time no see

00:28:10.070 --> 00:28:11.280
Master Chang Gang

00:28:51.320 --> 00:28:52.690
It's a soul swallower

00:28:55.650 --> 00:28:57.870
Chan Wook must have killed him

00:28:58.450 --> 00:28:59.530
Killed with one blow

00:29:01.040 --> 00:29:03.950
You cannot cast spells here. How did he do it?

00:29:06.330 --> 00:29:08.000
Where are Chan Wook and Moo Deok?

00:29:08.080 --> 00:29:09.170
Find them

00:29:09.880 --> 00:29:11.130
Yes

00:29:21.890 --> 00:29:25.020
I had a vision when I felt the energy of the ice stone

00:29:26.060 --> 00:29:28.560
The girl said no one can own the stone

00:29:28.650 --> 00:29:30.310
You can only use force

00:29:31.440 --> 00:29:33.070
Because this is the energy of the sky

00:29:33.820 --> 00:29:35.490
We have to train

00:29:36.070 --> 00:29:39.240
to control even the energy within us

00:29:39.320 --> 00:29:42.200
The energy of the sky, of course, is beyond our capabilities

00:29:42.280 --> 00:29:46.620
We can't use it freely because it doesn't belong to us.

00:29:49.420 --> 00:29:50.830
What if you don't master it?

00:29:51.920 --> 00:29:53.500
What if I give away all of mine?

00:29:54.210 --> 00:29:55.590
Give me yours?

00:29:55.670 --> 00:29:59.300
What if I put all my energy into the sky?

00:30:00.010 --> 00:30:02.350
Then my energy will become the energy of the sky

00:30:05.930 --> 00:30:08.060
I read the notes about the ice stone

00:30:08.140 --> 00:30:10.020
in the secret library of Jeonjingak

00:30:11.810 --> 00:30:14.730
They say ice stone has no shape

00:30:14.820 --> 00:30:17.650
It could be water, fire or wind

00:30:17.740 --> 00:30:19.950
It's impossible to know its size

00:30:20.030 --> 00:30:23.370
It can be either tiny or huge.

00:30:25.410 --> 00:30:28.370
This means that the barrier surrounding Jeongjingak

00:30:28.460 --> 00:30:30.290
not a true form of ice stone

00:30:30.830 --> 00:30:32.880
He can turn into water or fire,

00:30:32.960 --> 00:30:35.670
become larger or smaller than now

00:30:36.420 --> 00:30:37.460
Yes

00:30:37.550 --> 00:30:41.090
Do you think we can turn the fog into rain?

00:30:41.720 --> 00:30:42.720
In the rain?

00:30:42.800 --> 00:30:45.640
You said my strength is nothing compared to the power of a stone

00:30:46.270 --> 00:30:48.140
I only have control over a drop of water

00:30:48.230 --> 00:30:52.730
What if this drop turns into thousands of raindrops?

00:30:54.690 --> 00:30:56.820
It's going to rain

00:30:56.900 --> 00:30:58.440
This might work

00:30:59.320 --> 00:31:01.240
But for this you need to use Tansu

00:31:01.320 --> 00:31:03.660
- Then...
- Then I'll lose all my energy

00:31:04.700 --> 00:31:07.830
So I said I have to give it all away

00:31:12.000 --> 00:31:13.000
No

00:31:13.080 --> 00:31:14.790
Come up with another way

00:31:14.880 --> 00:31:17.750
We must hurry, otherwise the queen will gather all the power of the stone

00:31:18.760 --> 00:31:19.920
Then we'll all die

00:31:20.010 --> 00:31:23.760
The council is watching her, she won’t do anything rash

00:31:24.390 --> 00:31:26.890
Chan Wook, don't

00:31:27.510 --> 00:31:29.140
As your teacher, I command

00:31:37.900 --> 00:31:40.530
I gave up trying to get my strength back

00:31:40.610 --> 00:31:42.320
but I won’t let you waste mine

00:31:43.740 --> 00:31:45.820
We've come so far with you

00:31:46.660 --> 00:31:48.240
I pushed you so hard

00:31:48.330 --> 00:31:50.910
and you risked your life so many times

00:31:56.500 --> 00:31:59.960
And are you ready to give up everything for one drop?

00:32:03.510 --> 00:32:05.180
Yul is seriously wounded

00:32:05.260 --> 00:32:07.890
If nothing is done, he will die

00:32:13.600 --> 00:32:14.940
Moo Deok

00:32:15.560 --> 00:32:18.730
You gave up everything to protect me

00:32:22.190 --> 00:32:23.610
I want to protect you too

00:32:24.490 --> 00:32:28.530
And Yul also protected you all this time

00:32:39.130 --> 00:32:42.130
Without a transfusion he could die

00:32:45.510 --> 00:32:48.050
This worm is from the blood of the Jin family...

00:32:48.140 --> 00:32:49.760
If you give it to him...

00:33:26.380 --> 00:33:28.090
Don't die, sir

00:33:29.600 --> 00:33:31.100
Stay Alive

00:34:01.630 --> 00:34:04.090
Remove the reflector. What if someone sees?

00:34:04.670 --> 00:34:06.720
I can't stand it anymore

00:34:07.220 --> 00:34:09.090
I have to return the stone

00:34:09.180 --> 00:34:11.350
using a reflector

00:34:13.760 --> 00:34:15.020
Are you crazy?

00:34:15.100 --> 00:34:16.850
You can't use magic with a reflector,

00:34:16.930 --> 00:34:18.600
while the United Council is here

00:34:20.150 --> 00:34:21.310
Conjure?

00:34:24.730 --> 00:34:27.190
This reflector was made from ice stone

00:34:27.280 --> 00:34:30.110
But the stone is considered good and the reflector is evil

00:34:30.200 --> 00:34:32.320
This is ridiculous

00:34:32.410 --> 00:34:36.410
Think it's ridiculous, but that's the way of the world

00:34:36.500 --> 00:34:39.250
We do this so that you can come out of the darkness.

00:34:39.330 --> 00:34:41.790
without the stigma of a witch

00:34:42.540 --> 00:34:43.540
A stigma?

00:34:45.130 --> 00:34:48.010
You've come this far using my family's alchemy.

00:34:48.090 --> 00:34:50.630
How dare you treat this with contempt?

00:34:53.550 --> 00:34:58.350
I'm just saying that soul alchemy is an unrecognized witchcraft

00:34:59.810 --> 00:35:02.190
Why should the world admit this?

00:35:02.900 --> 00:35:06.070
When we found the ice rock at Gyeongjeongdaeho Lake ten years ago,

00:35:06.150 --> 00:35:09.780
we could use his power to elevate the Choi family

00:35:09.860 --> 00:35:10.860
However,

00:35:10.950 --> 00:35:14.030
you insisted that I enter the queen's body,

00:35:14.120 --> 00:35:16.410
created a secret organization in Jeonbugwan,

00:35:16.490 --> 00:35:17.660
and now

00:35:18.540 --> 00:35:22.460
you demand that the ice stone be revealed to the world through Jinyeowon

00:35:23.790 --> 00:35:27.840
It was too dangerous to go against the world with witchcraft

00:35:27.920 --> 00:35:31.760
It's not about the danger, it's about your contempt

00:35:32.260 --> 00:35:34.720
I didn't want to be branded for witchcraft.

00:35:34.800 --> 00:35:38.930
I wanted to use power so that everyone would worship you

00:35:42.270 --> 00:35:44.770
Why are you so desperate for recognition?

00:35:46.770 --> 00:35:50.030
Because you can't deal with the fact that

00:35:50.900 --> 00:35:53.990
born because of his father's affair and was never recognized

00:35:54.610 --> 00:35:59.450
a member of the Jin family, why did you have to wag your tail like a little dog in front of everyone?

00:36:13.050 --> 00:36:18.100
Apparently, the queen's position became a burden for her,

00:36:18.180 --> 00:36:22.390
that she previously received pennies for her fortune telling

00:36:26.730 --> 00:36:31.530
If it's so difficult, I'll get you a couple of human sacrifices

00:36:31.610 --> 00:36:36.110
Feast on their souls and pull yourself together

00:37:03.390 --> 00:37:06.480
Have you found the real queen?

00:37:07.730 --> 00:37:11.270
Did you bring her to Sosnovy Bor?

00:37:11.360 --> 00:37:12.320
Yes

00:37:12.400 --> 00:37:14.240
She is with Jin Cho Young

00:37:17.070 --> 00:37:18.820
Take her to the science room

00:37:18.910 --> 00:37:20.450
I will reveal the truth to everyone

00:37:21.160 --> 00:37:22.290
No, head

00:37:22.950 --> 00:37:26.120
Tell this only to the royal family and the people of Jinyeowon

00:37:27.500 --> 00:37:31.710
You are the future head of Sosnovy Bor,

00:37:31.800 --> 00:37:35.590
but standing here and worrying about Jinyoewon's reputation?

00:37:37.300 --> 00:37:38.890
I don't deny it

00:37:40.680 --> 00:37:43.890
But Sosnovy Bor is also responsible for this

00:37:45.600 --> 00:37:49.270
The Magician of Sosnovy Bor was the beginning of everything

00:37:49.350 --> 00:37:52.360
Magician from Sosnovy Bor? Who?

00:37:53.150 --> 00:37:56.950
Chan Wook's father, Gwangju Chang Gang

00:38:16.630 --> 00:38:18.380
At the request of Sosnovy Bor

00:38:18.470 --> 00:38:21.640
I sent everyone away except the magicians Jeonbugwan and Jinyeowon

00:38:23.050 --> 00:38:24.680
What do you want to tell us?

00:38:26.180 --> 00:38:30.730
I heard that the Crown Prince was looking for someone recently

00:38:31.480 --> 00:38:33.520
Park Dan Gu, magician of Jeongjingak,

00:38:33.610 --> 00:38:36.780
and Jin Cho Young, priestess of Jinyoung found this man

00:38:38.240 --> 00:38:40.160
Was the Crown Prince looking for someone?

00:38:41.280 --> 00:38:42.570
And who was it?

00:38:44.200 --> 00:38:46.750
This man is here now

00:38:51.710 --> 00:38:53.000
I heard someone threw a stone

00:38:53.080 --> 00:38:55.800
where it is written that the ice stone takes away strength when casting spells

00:38:55.880 --> 00:38:58.840
They can't cast spells?

00:38:58.920 --> 00:39:01.300
The same power is used in soul alchemy

00:39:01.380 --> 00:39:04.760
I guess the stone drains strength the same way it sucks souls

00:39:04.850 --> 00:39:08.430
Then what will happen to our children?

00:39:08.520 --> 00:39:10.730
You all wanted to kill someone so badly,

00:39:10.810 --> 00:39:13.400
to see the power of the stone

00:39:13.480 --> 00:39:15.360
Are you scared now?

00:39:15.940 --> 00:39:19.860
The power of the ice stone is beyond human control

00:39:19.950 --> 00:39:22.780
That's why Sosnovy Bor insisted on its destruction

00:39:22.860 --> 00:39:24.910
Then Sosnovy Bor must take action

00:39:25.450 --> 00:39:27.410
My son is there

00:39:27.490 --> 00:39:28.950
My granddaughter too

00:39:29.450 --> 00:39:32.330
If only I knew what to do, I wouldn't just stand here

00:39:33.670 --> 00:39:35.210
Everyone here was thirsty

00:39:35.290 --> 00:39:37.630
the power of heaven, and look where it led

00:39:38.420 --> 00:39:40.840
What if this leads to Chaos,

00:39:40.920 --> 00:39:43.680
like 200 years ago?

00:39:44.260 --> 00:39:45.350
Seo Kyung...

00:39:46.350 --> 00:39:48.350
Master So Kyung destroyed ice stones

00:39:49.470 --> 00:39:52.310
He left nothing but "Words of the Heart"?

00:39:52.390 --> 00:39:56.270
This poem is the only thing we have

00:39:57.320 --> 00:39:59.570
We called upon the power of the ice stone,

00:39:59.650 --> 00:40:02.280
one of us needs to fix this,

00:40:03.240 --> 00:40:05.780
like Master Seo Kyung many years ago

00:40:12.210 --> 00:40:15.040
Make it rain to dispel the power of the stone?

00:40:16.130 --> 00:40:17.920
Not sure if it will rain

00:40:18.000 --> 00:40:21.170
and will this rain be able to rid us of the barrier

00:40:22.010 --> 00:40:23.550
One thing I'll say for sure

00:40:24.470 --> 00:40:26.050
If you use Tansu here...

00:40:27.010 --> 00:40:28.100
Chan Wook...

00:40:29.010 --> 00:40:31.020
you will lose all your energy

00:40:32.140 --> 00:40:33.520
I know

00:40:33.600 --> 00:40:35.100
And still want to try?

00:40:38.020 --> 00:40:40.280
Maybe you're not a top-level magician,

00:40:40.860 --> 00:40:43.820
but you still went through a lot to get this far

00:40:44.490 --> 00:40:46.030
And are you willing to lose everything?

00:40:49.120 --> 00:40:50.790
I'll deal with it

00:40:51.370 --> 00:40:53.460
But I want you to help me with something

00:40:55.120 --> 00:40:57.790
If the ice stone disappears,

00:40:58.460 --> 00:41:01.300
take care of the rest

00:41:03.970 --> 00:41:06.550
Those who craved his power will resent

00:41:06.630 --> 00:41:10.310
They may suspect something is wrong and think that it is hidden somewhere

00:41:10.390 --> 00:41:14.600
That is, act as if I destroyed the stone

00:41:14.680 --> 00:41:16.810
and deal with the consequences?

00:41:16.900 --> 00:41:20.150
Take responsibility for what you did?

00:41:20.230 --> 00:41:22.280
I ask you to put everything in order

00:41:22.360 --> 00:41:25.070
after the mess I make

00:41:30.160 --> 00:41:31.240
Chan Wook,

00:41:31.950 --> 00:41:34.200
in addition to energy, you can also lose your life

00:41:34.290 --> 00:41:36.080
Don't be stupid, just forget about it

00:41:39.080 --> 00:41:41.000
My amazing teacher

00:41:41.540 --> 00:41:44.760
always pushed me to the edge of a cliff and said the following:

00:41:45.300 --> 00:41:48.760
"It's better to die than to do nothing"

00:41:51.100 --> 00:41:54.850
I will try not out of stupidity, but out of stubbornness

00:41:55.730 --> 00:41:57.640
That's what my teacher taught me

00:42:01.900 --> 00:42:03.820
Didn't know you had a teacher

00:42:03.900 --> 00:42:07.740
Who is this? Master Lee Chul?

00:42:09.780 --> 00:42:10.780
Owner

00:42:14.580 --> 00:42:15.750
I brought a sword

00:42:22.540 --> 00:42:23.500
Won Moo Deok

00:42:24.960 --> 00:42:27.630
Aren't you going to talk him out of this recklessness?

00:42:29.010 --> 00:42:32.760
It's better to die than to do nothing

00:42:36.600 --> 00:42:37.560
owner,

00:42:39.060 --> 00:42:40.600
do what you have to do

00:42:41.190 --> 00:42:42.230
And...

00:42:43.150 --> 00:42:44.730
I believe in you

00:43:03.210 --> 00:43:08.210
The person who enters here is in terrible condition.

00:43:08.800 --> 00:43:10.130
20 years ago

00:43:10.220 --> 00:43:13.600
she threw herself into the fire to hide from Jeonbugwan

00:43:19.430 --> 00:43:21.640
This is a shaman, she was telling fortunes

00:43:22.810 --> 00:43:24.150
and cursed people

00:43:27.280 --> 00:43:28.530
Shaman?

00:43:29.280 --> 00:43:33.070
She was locked like an animal for a very long time,

00:43:33.160 --> 00:43:36.740
in a tiny dungeon in the herbalist's shop in the village of Gema

00:43:39.200 --> 00:43:42.040
Why was it locked?

00:43:42.120 --> 00:43:44.290
I asked you to call this meeting

00:43:45.000 --> 00:43:47.420
in the hope of finding out, Your Majesty

00:43:49.170 --> 00:43:50.720
Everyone who is here

00:43:50.800 --> 00:43:56.260
associated with Shaman Choi, a woman who will soon enter this room

00:43:58.060 --> 00:44:00.310
- That's it?
- Your Majesty

00:44:00.390 --> 00:44:02.730
Now is not the time for this

00:44:03.310 --> 00:44:04.850
Ice stone is more important

00:44:04.940 --> 00:44:06.900
It's more important to save the Crown Prince

00:44:13.400 --> 00:44:18.200
Head Pak, bring the shaman here

00:44:23.750 --> 00:44:25.080
Come in

00:45:12.550 --> 00:45:16.130
Shaman Choi, show your face

00:45:43.620 --> 00:45:45.080
Your Majesty

00:45:46.750 --> 00:45:51.590
I never imagined in my dreams that I would see your face again

00:45:52.670 --> 00:45:55.420
Do you know me?

00:45:55.510 --> 00:45:58.430
I am your wife, Your Highness

00:45:58.970 --> 00:46:02.180
I, Seo Ha Sun, Queen Daeho

00:46:03.140 --> 00:46:04.140
Shut up!

00:46:04.220 --> 00:46:07.350
How dare you say my name with your dirty mouth?

00:46:08.020 --> 00:46:09.770
I am the queen of this country!

00:46:09.850 --> 00:46:11.440
How dare you?

00:46:12.190 --> 00:46:13.780
This is what you did to me

00:46:14.360 --> 00:46:17.700
You, pathetic shaman, used soul alchemy

00:46:17.780 --> 00:46:20.320
to transfer your dirty soul...

00:46:21.570 --> 00:46:25.910
into my sacred body, the body of the queen!

00:46:26.000 --> 00:46:27.830
I've had enough of your lies

00:46:28.500 --> 00:46:30.120
Deputy Gwangju, don't stand there like a pillar!

00:46:30.210 --> 00:46:32.290
Shut that crazy woman up now!

00:46:34.340 --> 00:46:38.470
First, we need to check

00:46:38.550 --> 00:46:40.840
whether she's lying or not

00:46:42.350 --> 00:46:43.390
Okay

00:46:44.470 --> 00:46:46.270
She says her soul has been moved

00:46:46.350 --> 00:46:49.560
Let's check if the Queen has a blue mark on her body

00:46:54.230 --> 00:46:58.150
I'll be happy to show it to you to help clear your suspicions

00:47:08.580 --> 00:47:12.210
Should I expose my shoulder here?

00:47:12.290 --> 00:47:16.500
The blue mark can be easily removed

00:47:16.590 --> 00:47:18.090
Otherwise there is nothing to prove

00:47:21.800 --> 00:47:23.300
We have Gwigu

00:47:32.350 --> 00:47:33.690
I have ashes

00:47:33.770 --> 00:47:38.900
cremated dog in which Gwigu's soul lived

00:47:40.610 --> 00:47:43.030
What's left of Gwigu's forces will help us...

00:47:48.540 --> 00:47:49.410
reveal the truth

00:47:54.210 --> 00:47:56.000
No!

00:47:59.840 --> 00:48:02.260
No!

00:48:09.270 --> 00:48:10.520
You see,

00:48:11.480 --> 00:48:12.600
it was...

00:48:13.900 --> 00:48:15.610
just collected ashes

00:48:16.560 --> 00:48:18.070
from the fryer

00:48:32.000 --> 00:48:33.830
You just proved it yourself

00:48:34.420 --> 00:48:37.920
that you are a nomad

00:48:47.350 --> 00:48:49.140
Grab the shaman Choi,

00:48:49.220 --> 00:48:53.430
who used soul alchemy to seize power

00:48:53.520 --> 00:48:54.810
in the queen's body!

00:48:54.890 --> 00:48:55.980
- Eat!
- Eat!

00:48:56.600 --> 00:48:57.730
No!

00:49:00.270 --> 00:49:04.030
Don't harm her. This is my body

00:49:04.780 --> 00:49:08.030
My soul must return to this body. Don't harm him

00:49:09.120 --> 00:49:10.740
Don't come any closer

00:49:12.200 --> 00:49:16.370
Otherwise I'll tear this body to pieces

00:49:16.960 --> 00:49:18.830
She is a descendant of the magician Choi,

00:49:18.920 --> 00:49:22.170
which caused the Great Chaos 200 years ago

00:49:23.590 --> 00:49:26.800
And the reflectors are probably her work

00:49:27.720 --> 00:49:30.220
This explains the recent appearances of soul swallowers

00:49:31.260 --> 00:49:33.220
This is an evil witch

00:49:33.310 --> 00:49:35.890
showed an ice stone in front of the Unified Council

00:49:36.480 --> 00:49:38.440
and made everyone look like complete fools

00:49:39.610 --> 00:49:41.440
All magicians in Deho

00:49:42.570 --> 00:49:45.860
Royal Family, Jeonbugwan and Jinyeowon

00:49:46.450 --> 00:49:48.490
Everyone was fooled

00:49:48.570 --> 00:49:53.620
brother and sister of the Choi family

00:49:55.040 --> 00:49:56.210
"Brother and sister"?

00:50:03.300 --> 00:50:04.670
So,

00:50:05.800 --> 00:50:09.220
Are you and this shaman brother and sister?

00:50:13.760 --> 00:50:15.560
Are you a member of the Choi family?

00:50:23.520 --> 00:50:24.980
Yes

00:50:29.360 --> 00:50:30.610
I'm sorry

00:50:34.040 --> 00:50:36.410
The daughter you recently found, Jin Bu Young,

00:50:36.500 --> 00:50:38.120
also fake

00:50:39.330 --> 00:50:40.460
which they picked up

00:50:41.830 --> 00:50:45.960
Her next plan was to move into the body

00:50:46.050 --> 00:50:48.380
Jinyoewon's heiress

00:51:00.520 --> 00:51:01.730
Shaman Choi,

00:51:01.810 --> 00:51:03.400
put down the dagger

00:51:03.480 --> 00:51:06.440
and return this body to Her Royal Highness

00:51:06.530 --> 00:51:07.740
Do as I say

00:51:08.650 --> 00:51:13.490
and I will spare your brother's life

00:51:25.800 --> 00:51:27.510
You say I'm evil

00:51:30.170 --> 00:51:31.800
But no one is here

00:51:32.840 --> 00:51:35.890
has no right to call me that

00:51:37.390 --> 00:51:38.850
Want to know

00:51:38.930 --> 00:51:42.730
How did I manage to take possession of the queen's sacred body?

00:51:44.610 --> 00:51:49.070
She gladly gave me her body because she wanted to move her soul

00:51:49.150 --> 00:51:51.740
into a young and beautiful body

00:51:51.820 --> 00:51:52.780
Jin Ho Kyung!

00:51:54.070 --> 00:51:56.950
Weren't you the one who announced the ice stone to the whole world?

00:51:58.120 --> 00:52:01.370
You are the head of Jinyeowon, the protector of his relics.

00:52:01.460 --> 00:52:02.790
And you let the stone

00:52:02.870 --> 00:52:06.250
leave Jinyeowon to use it for alchemy

00:52:07.840 --> 00:52:11.760
And the one who performed the alchemy of souls,

00:52:13.220 --> 00:52:15.010
was the magician of Sosnovy Bor

00:52:16.050 --> 00:52:17.560
Park Jin!

00:52:17.640 --> 00:52:20.350
You hid the truth even though you knew everything

00:52:21.060 --> 00:52:25.270
Acted like you couldn't wait to catch everyone who does magic.

00:52:25.350 --> 00:52:30.230
But you were just trying to hide the sin of that magician

00:52:39.950 --> 00:52:41.410
As for you, Jin Mu

00:52:42.830 --> 00:52:46.630
Why are you just standing there and doing nothing?

00:52:48.590 --> 00:52:52.800
I'm the only evil according to your logic and excuses

00:52:54.260 --> 00:52:56.090
which you came up with

00:53:07.350 --> 00:53:09.400
Logic is determined by power

00:53:09.480 --> 00:53:14.360
You've lost your power and that makes you evil

00:53:18.200 --> 00:53:20.160
Jin Mu, you will not fail to disappoint

00:53:21.200 --> 00:53:25.080
Your devotion is as fickle as the wind

00:53:25.160 --> 00:53:27.210
Pass the rest of the reflectors

00:53:28.000 --> 00:53:29.500
We will return the queen's body

00:53:29.590 --> 00:53:31.670
and you won't turn to stone

00:53:32.880 --> 00:53:37.130
I advise you to follow my words if you want your brother to live

00:53:38.220 --> 00:53:39.720
Sister

00:53:39.800 --> 00:53:42.520
Use the remaining reflector to escape

00:53:44.600 --> 00:53:47.390
This is the only thing I can do for you

00:53:49.940 --> 00:53:51.020
I'm really sorry

00:53:54.530 --> 00:53:55.860
Father!

00:53:55.950 --> 00:53:57.070
Father!

00:53:58.610 --> 00:53:59.570
Father!

00:54:07.460 --> 00:54:08.620
Father...

00:54:20.840 --> 00:54:22.300
Father...

00:54:42.410 --> 00:54:46.580
I will do as you want and get rid of the evil ice stone!

00:54:46.660 --> 00:54:47.870
However,

00:54:48.580 --> 00:54:50.540
as soon as the ice stone disappears,

00:54:51.380 --> 00:54:56.340
you will all die too

00:56:31.390 --> 00:56:32.890
- Look
- What is this?

00:57:31.830 --> 00:57:32.660
Chang Gang?

00:57:33.330 --> 00:57:34.290
Is this Chang Gan?

00:57:35.000 --> 00:57:37.790
Jang Gang, Jeonbugwan's gwangju?

00:57:38.380 --> 00:57:41.050
Chang Gang, is it really you?

00:57:41.630 --> 00:57:43.460
What are you doing here?

00:58:07.860 --> 00:58:09.200
Soul reflector...

00:58:19.460 --> 00:58:21.590
The reflector energy has disappeared

00:58:22.460 --> 00:58:25.300
Someone stopped it

00:58:29.050 --> 00:58:30.510
Gwangju Chang Gan is here

00:58:47.320 --> 00:58:48.740
Chang Gan...

00:58:49.950 --> 00:58:52.830
You have absorbed the energy of the reflector...

00:58:54.160 --> 00:58:55.700
into your body?

00:59:02.540 --> 00:59:05.710
Don't go near him

00:59:05.800 --> 00:59:08.090
Chang Gan is a nomad and he went wild

00:59:08.800 --> 00:59:10.050
Look

00:59:10.130 --> 00:59:13.010
His whole body turns to stone

00:59:15.640 --> 00:59:16.520
He's right

00:59:17.850 --> 00:59:20.980
I performed the forbidden alchemy of souls and became a nomad

00:59:21.690 --> 00:59:22.900
Now I'm running wild

00:59:24.400 --> 00:59:26.110
You are Jeonbugwan's gwangju

00:59:26.190 --> 00:59:28.150
And did you use witchcraft?

00:59:28.240 --> 00:59:31.070
Master Lee Chul, student of Master So Kyung,

00:59:32.360 --> 00:59:35.990
ordered me to confess my sins before the Unified Council

00:59:37.240 --> 00:59:38.910
That's why I'm here

00:59:43.670 --> 00:59:46.210
If you still have the strength to read this letter,

00:59:46.300 --> 00:59:49.260
use your remaining strength to help those who are suffering

00:59:49.340 --> 00:59:51.010
the mess you made

00:59:52.470 --> 00:59:55.260
This is your chance to finish what you started.

00:59:56.100 --> 00:59:58.930
Then a star will rise

00:59:59.020 --> 01:00:01.060
and the stone will sink

01:00:05.520 --> 01:00:07.320
I'm responsible

01:00:08.400 --> 01:00:11.490
for all the mistakes of Sosnovy Bor, Jinyeowon and Jeonbugwan

01:00:12.990 --> 01:00:15.030
I took the ice stone from Jinyaewon

01:00:16.120 --> 01:00:18.120
and performed witchcraft on them

01:00:19.540 --> 01:00:22.250
I tried to keep it a secret

01:00:23.750 --> 01:00:26.670
I'll be petrified here to atone for all my sins

01:00:29.170 --> 01:00:32.050
Gwangju Chang Gang was the one who started it all

01:00:32.130 --> 01:00:34.680
so I'll let him end it

01:00:35.760 --> 01:00:37.050
death

01:00:44.940 --> 01:00:47.730
Witness the tragic fall of man,

01:00:48.690 --> 01:00:50.110
who performed witchcraft

01:00:50.190 --> 01:00:52.190
Maybe he's a nomad

01:00:52.280 --> 01:00:53.990
but you can't leave him to die like this

01:00:54.070 --> 01:00:56.570
His son, Chan Wook, inside Jeongjingak

01:00:56.660 --> 01:00:59.740
Wait until Chan Wook gets out of there

01:00:59.830 --> 01:01:03.210
He deserves to say goodbye to his father

01:01:03.290 --> 01:01:05.000
He is not my son!

01:01:05.620 --> 01:01:07.670
You all know that I sealed his energy gate,

01:01:07.750 --> 01:01:10.000
to stop him from following in my footsteps

01:01:13.840 --> 01:01:15.550
His childhood was already sad

01:01:16.800 --> 01:01:19.100
Don't let him be known as the son of a sinner

01:02:26.870 --> 01:02:28.330
Where am I?

01:02:34.090 --> 01:02:36.800
What's happening? Am I dead?

01:02:49.520 --> 01:02:50.690
Well it happened

01:02:51.770 --> 01:02:53.520
My energy is gone

01:03:14.290 --> 01:03:15.590
Is this an ice stone?

01:03:16.800 --> 01:03:20.840
I found him when all my strength left me

01:03:22.390 --> 01:03:23.680
For me now

01:03:24.890 --> 01:03:26.640
it's nothing more than just a stone

01:03:51.210 --> 01:03:53.000
This is the King's star!

01:03:53.080 --> 01:03:55.630
The King's Star lit up in the sky

01:04:32.120 --> 01:04:35.000
The King's star shone in the sky, and the barrier fell

01:04:49.810 --> 01:04:51.560
The ice stone has disappeared

01:04:52.520 --> 01:04:54.690
and the King's star appeared

01:04:55.900 --> 01:04:58.230
When Master Seo Kyung stopped the Great Chaos

01:04:58.320 --> 01:05:00.690
the King's star also appeared

01:05:01.530 --> 01:05:04.700
So someone is inside Jeongjingak

01:05:04.780 --> 01:05:07.820
was born with the same fate as Master Seo Kyung?

01:05:27.930 --> 01:05:29.760
The King's Star above him

01:05:29.850 --> 01:05:31.770
It's him!

01:05:46.700 --> 01:05:48.530
Crown Prince

01:05:49.120 --> 01:05:52.200
The King's Star has shone for you!

01:05:52.290 --> 01:05:54.500
- Your Highness!
- Your Highness!

01:06:09.090 --> 01:06:12.010
Chan Wook was born under the star sign of the King

01:06:13.310 --> 01:06:16.100
Did he get rid of the ice stone?

01:06:44.300 --> 01:06:46.380
My student, you have lost all your energy

01:06:48.220 --> 01:06:52.220
Master, you too have become just Moo Deok

01:06:54.850 --> 01:06:56.390
I don't mind

01:06:57.390 --> 01:06:58.980
as long as we're together

01:07:35.510 --> 01:07:38.100
I heard that the wedding will take place in Sosnovy Bor

01:07:38.180 --> 01:07:40.940
Certainly. Groom - magician of Sosnovy Bor

01:07:41.440 --> 01:07:43.230
I don't approve of their wedding

01:07:43.310 --> 01:07:45.730
I can't believe they're getting married

01:07:45.820 --> 01:07:47.780
I've seen them together a couple of times

01:07:47.860 --> 01:07:49.530
They look good together

01:07:49.610 --> 01:07:52.410
What? They could have chosen a better groom

01:07:52.490 --> 01:07:53.870
What are you talking about?

01:07:53.950 --> 01:07:55.870
The same can be said about the bride

01:07:55.950 --> 01:07:57.660
People just talked

01:07:57.740 --> 01:08:00.080
about the United Council and the King's star

01:08:00.160 --> 01:08:03.000
And now they are discussing the upcoming wedding

01:08:04.630 --> 01:08:07.880
That's why the head insisted on the wedding

01:08:07.960 --> 01:08:11.340
I have to admit, I still can't believe these two are getting married.

01:08:14.010 --> 01:08:17.390
Mister Yul, I heard that you didn’t eat anything

01:08:18.060 --> 01:08:19.970
I eat when I'm hungry

01:08:20.060 --> 01:08:21.770
Let me make you some kuksa

01:08:22.390 --> 01:08:24.020
And you have to take medicine

01:08:26.110 --> 01:08:29.150
I don't need medications anymore. Stop bothering me with them

01:08:29.730 --> 01:08:31.610
You'll be returning to Soho Fortress soon

01:08:31.700 --> 01:08:33.660
You need to eat well while you're here...

01:08:40.040 --> 01:08:41.540
My wound has healed

01:08:42.540 --> 01:08:43.920
The energy is back too

01:08:45.460 --> 01:08:47.670
I heard you moaning in pain in your sleep

01:08:48.590 --> 01:08:50.000
I know you're lying

01:08:52.590 --> 01:08:54.090
The wound hardly hurts

01:09:00.060 --> 01:09:03.390
You're such a bad liar

01:09:05.190 --> 01:09:08.230
You have a pure heart, so every time you lie,

01:09:08.820 --> 01:09:10.820
it's obvious

01:09:12.780 --> 01:09:14.530
It's written right on your face

01:09:16.700 --> 01:09:19.620
It must have been difficult for you to hide it for so long

01:09:27.250 --> 01:09:28.420
Sorry

01:09:30.550 --> 01:09:32.010
And thank you,

01:09:33.880 --> 01:09:35.090
what they were defending

01:09:41.680 --> 01:09:45.140
Yul protected you all this time

01:09:48.770 --> 01:09:50.820
He knows who you are

01:09:52.190 --> 01:09:53.690
Knows that you are a nomad

01:09:53.780 --> 01:09:55.650
Knows that you are Nak Soo

01:09:56.530 --> 01:09:58.320
He tried so hard not to show it

01:10:03.700 --> 01:10:07.460
He really wanted to protect the girl he met in Danhyangok.

01:10:15.920 --> 01:10:17.380
This

01:10:17.470 --> 01:10:20.600
belongs to your friend from Danhyangok

01:10:22.100 --> 01:10:23.220
Yes

01:10:25.310 --> 01:10:27.600
I wanted to take her with me

01:10:27.690 --> 01:10:29.770
to Soho Fortress

01:10:35.530 --> 01:10:39.070
She had a secret that she was hiding from everyone

01:10:41.160 --> 01:10:43.450
So I wanted to take her there and hide her

01:10:48.250 --> 01:10:49.920
I promised you that I would help

01:10:50.750 --> 01:10:53.670
take her with you

01:10:55.710 --> 01:10:59.590
But this person now exists only in your memories

01:11:00.550 --> 01:11:02.430
She is no longer in this world

01:11:11.650 --> 01:11:13.150
At first I thought

01:11:13.230 --> 01:11:16.480
cremation will erase her from your memory

01:11:17.940 --> 01:11:20.570
But you said that you cherish the memories from Danhyangok

01:11:26.330 --> 01:11:27.660
Take it with you

01:11:41.050 --> 01:11:43.180
I want to make sure you are on the mend.

01:11:44.140 --> 01:11:46.390
That's why I want to feel your three breaths

01:12:07.200 --> 01:12:09.160
Let's say goodbye to each other

01:12:12.000 --> 01:12:14.790
while these three breaths last

01:12:27.310 --> 01:12:29.680
The memories were dear to me too

01:12:31.730 --> 01:12:33.600
from Danhyangok

01:12:40.740 --> 01:12:42.070
Thanks for everything

01:13:22.940 --> 01:13:25.530
It seems your wound is healing well

01:13:26.910 --> 01:13:31.370
I know the medicine is bitter, but take it regularly

01:13:38.380 --> 01:13:39.500
Okay

01:13:41.170 --> 01:13:43.380
I will drink it, no matter how bitter it is

01:13:48.180 --> 01:13:49.890
This time the wound will heal completely

01:14:29.260 --> 01:14:32.600
Sacrificing my life

01:14:32.680 --> 01:14:38.020
your father took responsibility for what happened

01:14:38.900 --> 01:14:42.070
Thanks to his sacrifice, Sosnovy Bor and Jinyeowon were not punished

01:14:49.950 --> 01:14:52.490
Perhaps he denied that you were his son,

01:14:53.200 --> 01:14:57.620
because he didn't want you to be blamed for his sins

01:15:01.290 --> 01:15:02.630
Don't worry

01:15:03.130 --> 01:15:07.260
I no longer care about the fact that he may not be my father.

01:15:11.430 --> 01:15:14.890
Do you recognize your father?

01:15:15.770 --> 01:15:17.890
You haven't met before

01:15:20.520 --> 01:15:21.900
We met once

01:15:23.310 --> 01:15:24.730
Perhaps then

01:15:26.030 --> 01:15:27.490
he recognized me

01:15:28.570 --> 01:15:29.860
It seems you

01:15:30.570 --> 01:15:32.240
you know who I am

01:15:32.910 --> 01:15:35.240
You have Jeongbugwan's gwangju sword

01:15:35.330 --> 01:15:36.830
You must be his son

01:16:08.730 --> 01:16:12.110
This is the sword and robe that the royal family gave to Chang Gan,

01:16:12.200 --> 01:16:15.490
to the former Gwangju of Jeonbugwan who died due to witchcraft

01:16:15.580 --> 01:16:20.290
We'd like you to decide what we should do with his things.

01:16:20.870 --> 01:16:22.330
Leave in Sosnovy Bor

01:16:23.750 --> 01:16:25.840
Have you found Deputy Jin Mu?

01:16:26.590 --> 01:16:27.710
We're still looking for him

01:16:28.710 --> 01:16:31.510
We are sure he has not left the capital yet

01:16:31.590 --> 01:16:33.300
He could take over another body

01:16:34.550 --> 01:16:36.970
If he does to himself what he did to me,

01:16:37.050 --> 01:16:38.640
Will Sosnovy Bor recognize him?

01:16:39.770 --> 01:16:41.980
You've been fooled all these years

01:16:45.900 --> 01:16:47.230
Your Highness

01:16:47.320 --> 01:16:51.030
Master Kang of Degangtong went mad and petrified,

01:16:51.110 --> 01:16:53.200
but Saejukwon managed to save him

01:16:53.820 --> 01:16:57.370
If you ever go wild and start to turn to stone,

01:16:57.450 --> 01:16:59.290
we know a way to save you

01:17:00.540 --> 01:17:01.830
What's the point?

01:17:02.370 --> 01:17:07.040
I will have to live in this terrible body for the rest of my life.

01:17:09.170 --> 01:17:11.920
You let Chan Wook live even though his father was guilty of

01:17:12.010 --> 01:17:14.130
what happened to me

01:17:14.220 --> 01:17:15.510
Chang Gang

01:17:16.090 --> 01:17:18.600
took full responsibility by sacrificing himself

01:17:19.510 --> 01:17:21.470
We also revoked Chan Wook's rights

01:17:22.350 --> 01:17:25.940
become the next gwangju jeonbugwan

01:17:27.150 --> 01:17:28.940
He washed away his sins

01:17:29.820 --> 01:17:32.190
having lost everything I had

01:17:34.030 --> 01:17:37.570
When Chang Gang died, he admitted that Wook was not his son.

01:17:37.660 --> 01:17:39.700
You can't put the responsibility on him

01:17:39.780 --> 01:17:43.450
Chang Gang died without revealing the name of Wook's real father.

01:17:51.630 --> 01:17:53.260
Master Chang Gang wanted

01:17:54.220 --> 01:17:56.510
so I can give this to you

01:18:01.350 --> 01:18:03.930
He said it would reveal the truth

01:18:04.930 --> 01:18:07.140
about Mr. Chan Wook's real father

01:18:30.420 --> 01:18:31.590
I think

01:18:32.840 --> 01:18:35.880
now you, maid Kim, know the truth

01:18:37.510 --> 01:18:38.970
I can't believe it

01:18:40.010 --> 01:18:43.810
Has Lady Do Hwa given birth to the late king's son?

01:18:44.470 --> 01:18:47.640
Uka was conceived when the late king transferred his soul...

01:18:48.770 --> 01:18:51.480
and lay down with Do Hwa

01:18:52.190 --> 01:18:56.530
Chang Gang performed alchemy and exchanged souls...

01:18:58.570 --> 01:19:00.200
with the late king

01:19:02.280 --> 01:19:07.120
Master Chang Gan ruined his son's life

01:19:08.960 --> 01:19:10.580
If the gentleman finds out about this...

01:19:12.080 --> 01:19:13.670
I won't reveal this

01:19:15.170 --> 01:19:18.800
Not only Uku,

01:19:19.970 --> 01:19:21.930
I will keep this a secret from everyone

01:19:25.930 --> 01:19:29.270
The star that appeared in the sky when you destroyed the ice stone

01:19:29.350 --> 01:19:31.730
was engraved on the constellation tablet

01:19:31.810 --> 01:19:35.480
Everyone is happy to welcome the king, born under the sign of the star of the King

01:19:35.570 --> 01:19:37.230
Would you like to take a look at the sign?

01:19:39.150 --> 01:19:40.320
No

01:19:52.710 --> 01:19:54.090
Deputy of Gwangju

01:19:55.130 --> 01:19:57.510
transmigrated the soul and disappeared?

01:20:28.290 --> 01:20:30.500
Have you been hiding in Jeonbugwan all this time?

01:20:31.000 --> 01:20:34.210
I've been waiting for the opportunity to meet you, Your Highness

01:20:36.750 --> 01:20:39.170
Are you asking me to save your life?

01:20:39.260 --> 01:20:41.880
Only you can save me

01:20:41.970 --> 01:20:45.640
and only I can protect you

01:20:46.390 --> 01:20:49.140
Protect me? From what?

01:20:49.220 --> 01:20:52.140
I will protect you from the real heir to the King's star

01:20:53.190 --> 01:20:56.440
-What are you talking about?
- You already know yourself

01:20:56.520 --> 01:20:58.940
you are not the true heir

01:21:04.820 --> 01:21:08.740
The man who will outshine you... The man who will be worshiped

01:21:08.830 --> 01:21:12.660
Man that will blow you away

01:21:13.250 --> 01:21:14.670
You're only second in line to the throne

01:21:14.750 --> 01:21:17.710
Chang Wook, the heir to the star, should not be allowed to

01:21:18.500 --> 01:21:19.750
rise above you

01:21:21.920 --> 01:21:26.590
I promise to deliver you from this ominous light

01:21:32.390 --> 01:21:34.640
The only thing I was desperate for...

01:21:37.350 --> 01:21:39.110
actually belongs to Chan Wook

01:22:07.010 --> 01:22:10.180
How sweet. You are beautiful

01:22:11.760 --> 01:22:14.480
You look great

01:22:16.640 --> 01:22:18.100
Wipe up the drool

01:22:18.690 --> 01:22:20.810
- You can take it off now
- Why are you...

01:22:20.900 --> 01:22:23.650
did she even ask me to wear this? Why not the bride?

01:22:23.730 --> 01:22:27.070
Her father is in very bad condition, so she couldn't come

01:22:27.150 --> 01:22:29.530
You and she have a similar physique, so

01:22:30.120 --> 01:22:31.330
You can change your clothes

01:22:32.870 --> 01:22:35.120
Come on. Let's go so she can change clothes

01:22:35.870 --> 01:22:38.790
- Stop staring. Let's go
- She's the most beautiful girl I've ever seen

01:22:38.870 --> 01:22:40.210
It's true

01:22:44.000 --> 01:22:45.130
I think

01:22:46.090 --> 01:22:47.720
I look cute

01:22:49.550 --> 01:22:50.640
Wait

01:22:50.720 --> 01:22:52.470
Is Moo Deok here? Where is she?

01:22:52.560 --> 01:22:53.810
Moo Deok is now...

01:22:56.640 --> 01:22:58.440
She's in that room

01:22:58.520 --> 01:22:59.980
- Come in
- Okay

01:23:10.700 --> 01:23:11.950
Wow...

01:23:12.740 --> 01:23:15.080
I heard someone is getting married soon

01:23:15.870 --> 01:23:16.790
Isn't that you?

01:23:17.710 --> 01:23:18.710
No

01:23:23.840 --> 01:23:25.710
Look, this is my teacher

01:23:26.460 --> 01:23:28.590
I told you to wait for me in Saejukwon

01:23:28.670 --> 01:23:31.510
- Why are you here?
- Ho Yeom sent me for wine

01:23:31.590 --> 01:23:33.260
Ah Joo Wol asked you to wear this

01:23:33.350 --> 01:23:36.180
I need to change clothes. Wait outside

01:23:36.270 --> 01:23:37.560
No, wait

01:23:37.640 --> 01:23:40.770
This place is suitable. This is where we first met

01:23:42.310 --> 01:23:43.980
Suitable for what?

01:23:45.820 --> 01:23:48.190
For the ritual we must perform

01:23:49.150 --> 01:23:50.820
First of all, sit here

01:24:01.710 --> 01:24:03.170
What's going on?

01:24:04.000 --> 01:24:05.210
This is optional

01:24:08.840 --> 01:24:12.260
Stop it. You're embarrassing me. What's wrong with you?

01:24:17.430 --> 01:24:19.310
It's just confusing at first

01:24:19.390 --> 01:24:21.190
But after the 13th time you get used to it

01:24:22.480 --> 01:24:23.560
What?

01:24:24.190 --> 01:24:26.270
Have you proposed 13 times?

01:24:28.780 --> 01:24:29.900
teacher,

01:24:30.610 --> 01:24:34.160
today I want to finish my studies with you

01:24:37.240 --> 01:24:40.250
Thank you for making me train hard

01:24:40.830 --> 01:24:43.080
Even though I was a complete idiot

01:24:45.250 --> 01:24:46.420
I know

01:24:46.500 --> 01:24:48.880
you left the opportunity to regain your power

01:24:49.670 --> 01:24:52.930
Just like I gave up the energy I so wanted to own.

01:24:53.720 --> 01:24:57.760
But I have something that I want to keep next to me all my life

01:25:01.560 --> 01:25:05.980
I don’t want to be used and thrown away. I want to protect and take care

01:25:06.650 --> 01:25:09.610
So... let me go

01:25:14.990 --> 01:25:16.490
Your teacher, Moo Deok,

01:25:17.570 --> 01:25:19.700
allows his student Chan Wook to leave

01:25:24.460 --> 01:25:25.500
Okay, then...

01:25:26.710 --> 01:25:29.550
Marry me, Moo Deok?

01:25:52.670 --> 01:25:56.970
Thanks for watching with us!
doramamania

01:25:57.060 --> 01:26:00.100
Alchemy

01:25:57.060 --> 01:26:00.100
Shower

01:26:01.830 --> 01:26:04.580
I decided to marry the owner

01:26:04.660 --> 01:26:05.870
You didn't even have a girlfriend

01:26:05.960 --> 01:26:07.670
It's all for Moo Deok

01:26:07.750 --> 01:26:08.670
Impossible!

01:26:08.750 --> 01:26:12.550
I will find a sword that will allow you to kill Chan Wook

01:26:12.630 --> 01:26:14.970
Jin Mu must die

01:26:15.050 --> 01:26:18.590
Are you saying they all deceived me and mocked me?

01:26:18.680 --> 01:26:20.970
They are trying to protect Chan Wook

01:26:21.050 --> 01:26:23.100
A killer appears in Sejukwon

01:26:23.180 --> 01:26:25.100
I think Moo Deok's body originally belonged to...

01:26:25.180 --> 01:26:27.100
someone with great divine power

01:26:28.270 --> 01:26:31.980
Nak Soo, you gave me hope
